WEBVTT

00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:32.648
some of the most amazing,
fierce and courageous human beings

00:01:32.648 --> 00:01:34.830
I had ever met.

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:36.934
It was the first time
the story of Stonewall

00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:38.986
had been told to a national audience.

00:01:38.986 --> 00:01:41.239
I dedicated the program to my dad,

00:01:41.249 --> 00:01:46.715
it changed my relationship with him,
and it changed my life.

00:01:48.181 --> 00:01:51.617
Over the next 15 years,
I made many more radio documentaries,

00:01:51.617 --> 00:01:55.681
working to shine a light on people
who are rarely heard from in the media.

00:01:55.681 --> 00:01:57.260
Over and over again,

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:59.860
I'd see how this simple act
of being interviewed

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.020
could mean so much to people,